Z||000000||WKDFIRO||02-03-2000||02:14 PM||||Alrighty then! (I can't beleive Im doing this...)<P>ANNOUNCING: THE SOUTHERN CALIFORNIA FEARLESS FIEROS ON A FRIDAY TOUR<BR> <BR>Friday March 17 at 11 AM! <P>Meeting Location:  Jack in the Box off of Green River north of the 91 freeway.<P>Itinerary:<P>Fiero Owners Club of America National Headquarters to meet and greet Fiero Phil, you thought you were crazy about Fieros, Phil started the club in 1983, yes, before the Fiero was actually sold. See the "Chop Top" Fiero, the famous "Factory Signed Formula" the Fiero that Phil walked down the assembly line with and had all the workers autograph the spaceframe and more!<P>Fiero Motorsports - The Fiero exclusive Performance and Repair facility where we will meet with Keith "Fiero Doc" Huff and John Parenti. Both Fiero legends in their own minds! You just might agree when you see their personal Fieros...<P>Afterwards....hey, we'll just play it by ear afterwards.<P>Well guys, what do yah think? Bunch of Fearless Fiero Freaks getting their fix for Friday? (say that 3 times fast!)<BR> <BR>Let me know what you think, I have the whole day off so it doesn't matter too much what time we go.<BR>||||reg||6
