Z||000012||WKDFIRO||03-20-2000||12:21 AM||||I wish you guys had mentioned that earlier! As it was it was a no go. I had lunch at the IN n Out by myself. I even raced over to the Jack in the Box just incase. I work on Sunday but the weather has so BEAUTIFUL! I just might have to play hooky! <BR>    Until we reschedule you are of course invited to our "Tire Kicker" that we have the first saturday of every month. This month, (April 1st) we are having FOCOA bringing out its goods and goods in the works. Indestructable GT fastback side panels prototypes (the ones that always split and crack) hopefully some headers and probably more.<P>Im sorry if I missed anybody on Friday!<P>Fiero Motorsports is at <BR>808 West Angus Unit D <BR>Orange, California 92868.<P>Hope to see you there! <BR>Special invite to Tom just for efforts on the further beautification of Fieros!<p>[This message has been edited by WKDFIRO (edited 03-20-2000).]||||reg||9
